  "description": "Overview Ideate • Innovate • Pitch Startupathon is an entrepreneurial challenge where teams transform innovative ideas into potential startup ventures. Identify a real-world problem, develop a viable solution, and showcase your innovation, business model, market understanding, scalability, feasibility, and entrepreneurial vision before the judges. Eligibility Open to college students across India. Each team must consist of 2–4 members. Dates: 16–17 October 2026 Venue: G.L. Bajaj Institute of Technology and Management Round 1 — Idea Submission Teams will submit their startup idea based on a given problem/theme. Problem Statement Proposed Solution Innovation / USP Target Users Basic Business Model Round 2 — Startup Pitch Shortlisted teams will pitch their startup idea before the judging panel. Problem–Solution Fit Market Potential Business Model Feasibility & Scalability Innovation Pitch & Q&A Think Big. Build Smart. Pitch Bold.",
