    "details": "<p><strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"80\">Overview</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"111\">Ideate &bull; Innovate &bull; Pitch</strong></p>\n<p>Startupathon is an entrepreneurial challenge where teams transform innovative ideas into potential startup ventures. Identify a real-world problem, develop a viable solution, and showcase your innovation, business model, market understanding, scalability, feasibility, and entrepreneurial vision before the judges.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Open to college students across India.</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Each team must consist of 2&ndash;4 members.</li>\n<li><strong>Dates:</strong>&nbsp;16&ndash;17 October 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong>&nbsp;G.L. Bajaj Institute of Technology and Management</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &mdash; Idea Submission</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Teams will submit their startup idea based on a given problem/theme.</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Problem Statement</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Proposed Solution</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Innovation / USP</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Target Users</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Basic Business Model</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &mdash; Startup Pitch</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shortlisted teams will pitch their startup idea before the judging panel.</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Problem&ndash;Solution Fit</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Market Potential</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Business Model</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Feasibility &amp; Scalability</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Innovation</li>\n<li class=\"artifact-docx-preview_listbullet artifact-docx-preview-num-1-0\">Pitch &amp; Q&amp;A</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"676\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Think Big. Build Smart. Pitch Bold.</strong></p>",
